ives, and carve a path through the swarm as they fight simply to see another day in a world overrun by the dead.", "summary": "Humanity is on the brink of extinction. From New York to Moscow and Jerusalem, the undead apocalypse continues to spread. As the end looms, a hardened few bands together to defeat the horde and outlive the dead.\n\nWorld War Z is a heart-pounding co-op third-person shooter for up to 4 players featuring swarms of hundreds of zombies. Based on the Paramount Pictures film, World War Z focuses on fast-paced gameplay while exploring new storylines from around the world.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/world-war-z", "videos": [{"id": 28513, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "TTg1PHzdOMA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TTg1PHzdOMA", "title": "World War Z - The Six Skulls Update | PS4", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TTg1PHzdOMA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 17109, "name": "Reveal Trailer", "video_id": "bJfRxQAmpsA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bJfRxQAmpsA", "title": "World War Z - Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bJfRxQAmpsA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 26198, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "1GRUgfRRvwM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1GRUgfRRvwM", "title": "World War Z - Gameplay Overview Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1GRUgfRRvwM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 26753, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "m-WAP4i1hLk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m-WAP4i1hLk", "title": "World War Z - Launch Trailer (GSA)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m-WAP4i1hLk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 25511, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "U316qh1wpDg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U316qh1wpDg", "title": "World War Z - Dev Diary", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U316qh1wpDg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 25906, "name": "Tokyo Trailer", "video_id": "x5wYdqDpbiw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x5wYdqDpbiw", "title": "Wor